00:58:34.190 --> 00:58:38.320
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who describes managing our show this way.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督是托里·马拉蒂亚，他这样描述我们节目的管理方式。

00:58:38.320 --> 00:58:46.140
<v Anne Staggs>The intensity of the relationship and the intensity of the feelings is far beyond anything that we've ever experienced before.
<v Anne Staggs>这种关系的强度和情感的强度远远超过我们以前经历过的任何事情。

00:58:46.140 --> 00:58:47.070
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。

00:58:47.070 --> 00:58:49.590
<v Anne Staggs>They never let him out of the building to come to the visitation area.
<v Anne Staggs>他们从未让他离开大楼去探视区。

00:58:49.590 --> 00:58:55.920
